This module is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE).

The code was written for SigmaM2M, a oneM2M platform, from the Philips
Hue developer documentation as far as it is public (PROVENANCE.md). It
contains no code from other projects. client.go and v1.go come from
SigmaM2M and carry no per-file copyright header, the convention of the
code they come from; the copyright line above covers them. Files added
for this module carry "Copyright 2026 Abhinav Gautam" and
"SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0".

Philips and Hue are trademarks of Koninklijke Philips N.V., used under
licence by Signify. This module is not made, endorsed or supported by
Philips or Signify; the names are used only to say which devices it
talks to.

The Hue bridge root CA is not included. A caller that wants the
certificate chain verified supplies it (TLSCheck.Roots, RootsFromPEM,
LoadRoots).

The typed views in models.go were written for this module. Their field
names follow the bridge's JSON and were cross-checked against the
openhue-api OpenAPI description (github.com/openhue/openhue-api, commit
1ffc817 of 2026-04-15; Apache-2.0, Copyright the openhue authors). No
text or code was copied and nothing was generated from it.

