Test peers
----------

The nested test-only module interop/ is not part of the published
module. It runs, in Docker, diyHue (github.com/diyhue/diyHue; its
BridgeEmulator code is Apache-2.0, its Lights directory CC BY-NC 4.0),
an open-source Hue bridge emulator, from its published image. No diyHue
code is included in this repository.

Test data
---------

Every bridge ID, application key, client key, MAC address, device name,
model number, firmware version and address in the tests and examples is
a made-up demo value. Product and model names are the real names of
product kinds, chosen to exercise each kind.
